me{arctan}⁡(-1)=${{field-1}}." 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427536 1072 #uuid "182a0a62-9cfb-58e4-8415-cea11f6e4f4a" 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427536 1074 "The range of $\\theta =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x$ is given by\n\n$$\n-\\frac{\\pi }{2}<\\theta <\\frac{\\pi }{2}.\n$$\n\nNote that the angle $\\theta $ spans the first and fourth quadrants.\n\nSince $-1$ is negative, our answer is an angle that lies in the fourth quadrant, where the tangent is negative.\n\nFrom the special values of the trigonometric functions, we know that \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{tan}⁡(-\\frac{\\pi }{4})=-1.\n$$\n\nSince $-\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ is an angle in the fourth quadrant that lies within the range of $arctan,$ we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(-1)=-\\frac{\\pi }{4}.\n$$" 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427537 1068 #edb/ref 17592186427534 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427537 1069 "q-320655" 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427537 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427537 1071 "Expressed in radians, $\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(1)=${{field-1}}." 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427537 1072 #uuid "1b6c5790-6cdf-5b8e-a3f0-2a4d7d5bea22" 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427537 1074 "First, note that the range of $\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x$ is given by\n\n$$\n0\\le \\theta \\le \\pi .\n$$\n\nNote that the angle $\\theta $ spans the first and second quadrants.\n\nNow, let's take a look at the unit circle.\n\n![](images/db/dbf36192ac332dc49ed75278838e989a37ac7d888311be1b8b059a7b59667aa6.png)\n\nFrom the values in the unit circle, we see that\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(1)=0.\n$$" 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427538 1068 #edb/ref 17592186427533 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427538 1069 "q-117402" 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427538 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427538 1071 "$\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})=$" 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427538 1072 #uuid "42857110-c4b5-5ac1-947b-caa358d2dbae" 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427538 1074 "First, note that the range of $\\theta =\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x$ is given by\n\n$$\n-{90}^{∘}\\le \\theta \\le {90}^{∘}.\n$$\n\nNote that the angle $\\theta $ spans the first and fourth quadrants.\n\nSince $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ is positive, our answer is an angle that lies in the first quadrant, where sine is positive.\n\n![](images/ca/ca39c4cde40b99fd40a11746a31398d82814268b2df706e3101ee88648c9e2d4.png)\n\nFrom the values in the first quadrant, we see that\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡({45}^{∘})=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})={45}^{∘}.\n$$" 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427539 1068 #edb/ref 17592186427535 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427539 1069 "q-320741" 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427539 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427539 1071 "Expressed in degrees, $\\frac{2}{5}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(1)=${{field-1}}${}^{∘}.$" 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427539 1072 #uuid "87ec257a-c863-5e49-a8f0-fba4f70038a2" 13194139534606 17592186045417 true] [17592186427539 1074 "The range of $\\theta =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x$ is given by\n\n$$\n-{90}^{∘}<\\theta <{90}^{∘}.\n$$\n\nNote that the angle $\\theta $ spans the first and fourth quadrants.\n\nSince $1$ is positive, our answer is an angle that lies in the first quadrant, where the tangent is positive.\n\nFrom the special values of the trigonometric functions, we know that \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{tan}⁡{45}^{∘}=1.\n$$\n\nSince ${45}^{∘}$ is an angle in the first quadrant that lies within the range of $arctan,$ we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(1)={45}^{∘}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{5}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(1)=\\frac{2}{5}\\cdot {45}^{∘}={18}^{∘}.\n$$" 13194139534606 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-0e3ea772-e772-52b8-9654-53b9a628393a" 17592186427519 "answer-108019a0-46c5-5872-8b39-0d3a33f620c2" 17592186427520 "answer-362fffeb-2576-5d58-b4ac-2e8e14f21e76" 17592186427521 "answer-5234a80f-3964-5f6b-929f-0367338cb2a2" 17592186427522 "answer-722eb547-e288-5ad4-ab49-790d9559959d" 17592186427523 "answer-9f118ded-6d77-5044-83fb-ddb49902a5ca" 17592186427524 "answer-a6de17e0-e776-5ca1-abdc-1fc86be8571c" 17592186427525 "answer-acf11764-516b-5536-8bd0-8896df8ccfb5" 17592186427526 "answer-ad1c072d-1fdd-5e3a-8540-bf8e8670a3bc" 17592186427527 "answer-e642531e-a868-556f-a278-25243d434fda" 17592186427528 "answer-ecae479f-b48b-5f1e-97cb-6dff17dcea7d" 17592186427529 "answer-f499bdbb-1a30-5059-8d7c-e95901e28a16" 17592186427530 "answer-ff26d36c-881d-524c-afc6-e0c4fa3b0fbb" 17592186427531 "answer-field-4d30847d-c042-5bde-bc2b-fabb63cbc1b6" 17592186427532 "answer-field-5d6bb41c-84e4-5e27-b04d-2ae6a3d15e1e" 17592186427533 "answer-field-74919736-ad9c-5028-b680-d5b5ce7007df" 17592186427534 "answer-field-797f7668-4aa0-52d3-afdc-f0d21caa5139" 17592186427535 "question-182a0a62-9cfb-58e4-8415-cea11f6e4f4a" 17592186427536 "question-1b6c5790-6cdf-5b8e-a3f0-2a4d7d5bea22" 17592186427537 "question-42857110-c4b5-5ac1-947b-caa358d2dbae" 17592186427538 "question-87ec257a-c863-5e49-a8f0-fba4f70038a2" 17592186427539} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
